  "content": "<h3><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>一個能提升所有玩家血量條品質、並以全新設計的圖素重塑視覺的材質包！</strong></span></h3><p><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://i.gyazo.com/23a702be91ea3e9e06ae16bc68c7d5f8.png&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"圖片\"></p><p>此迷你包的內容來自我正在開發的一款大型專案，名為<span style=\"color:#00e4ff\"><strong><a style=\"color:#00e4ff\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252frappenems-reforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rappenem's Reforge</a>&nbsp;</strong></span>，該專案旨在以這種風格重新製作整個遊戲的圖素。如果你喜歡這裡展示的像素藝術，不妨去看看，並在<span style=\"color:#ff49fa\"><strong>&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#ff49fa\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/Rappenem\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a></strong></span>上支持我，即可搶先體驗並獲得額外內容！</p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Rappenem\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fe2313e6ca2c3df47d179aa09bbc4c57799f6094.png\" alt=\"FF\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f2hvKFfPzQt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/95be1badf0f5131587308606c53801d55223882c.png\" alt=\"D\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252frappenems_reforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/77276c296d994e962ff04b57a57206c7abf516de.png\" alt=\"F\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fRapps_Reforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/24c2ce58d5be6a91a8fb4e14aee09b885f105ad5.png\" alt=\"H\"></a></p><p><strong>高品質圖素，細節更豐富、色盤更擴展！</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://i.gyazo.com/7504a77dcf99b4a30d866eefcb0a2a52.png&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"圖片\"></p><p><strong>更易於辨識的極限模式愛心</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2605446d39ac5b47d06f69761164a377df527111.gif\" alt=\"極限模式\"></p><p><strong>對騎乘生物時動物血量條的全新詮釋，捨棄了遊戲原本的「鞍心」設計，改用更具可讀性、更獨特的表現方式</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7ee6820b93831d948fe6b3c77238ade77f7ceb44.gif\" alt=\"騎乘\"></p><p><strong>更精細的容器圖素</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f3c667af4576f0d38850f84789315a6e96d2bcc5.gif\" alt=\"容器\"></p>",
